    hidden_k_1 = ReLU(L * (x - threshold[k]) + 1)
    hidden_k_2 = ReLU(L * (x - threshold[k]))

  Note that hidden_k_1 - hidden_k_2 is:
    1                 if x >= threshold[k] + 1/L
    0                 if x <= threshold[k]
    between 0 and 1   if threshold[k] < x < threshold[k] + 1/L

